Follow the rules in AGENTS.md at the repository root. Read it before making any change.
Key points: conda env `eu-trade-network`; all reusable logic lives in src/eu_trade_network;
notebooks orchestrate + visualise only; ruff + basedpyright + pytest must pass before a task
is "done"; never commit data/ or .env; conventional commit messages. The user commits, not
the agent — when done, remind the user to commit before the next task instead of committing.
